          "href": "https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/33304725419931-Troubleshooting-Meta-Ads-audience-creation-errors#h_01JJQC0HAVF71P7W7K30J9A6CJ",
          "text": "You will learn"
        },
        {
          "href": "https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/33304725419931-Troubleshooting-Meta-Ads-audience-creation-errors#h_01JJQC0HAVCDRCDNN77P2FS7TB",
          "text": "Before you begin"
        },
        {
          "href": "https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/33304725419931-Troubleshooting-Meta-Ads-audience-creation-errors#h_01JJQC0HAV2C5SJH63B88WCXJF",
          "text": "Troubleshooting steps"
